From: Luca Weiss <luca.weiss@fairphone.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Oct 2025 09:47:29 +0200
Subject: arm64: dts: qcom: sm7225-fairphone-fp4: Enable CCI pull-up

Enable vreg_l6p, which is the voltage source for the pull-up resistor of
the CCI busses.

This ensures that I2C communication works as expected.

Signed-off-by: Luca Weiss <luca.weiss@fairphone.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7225-fairphone-fp4.dts | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7225-fairphone-fp4.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7225-fairphone-fp4.dts
index ca88f61..547e1a6 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7225-fairphone-fp4.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7225-fairphone-fp4.dts
@@ -670,6 +670,8 @@ vreg_l6p: ldo6 {
 				regulator-name = "vreg_l6p";
 				regulator-min-microvolt = <1500000>;
 				regulator-max-microvolt = <1800000>;
+				/* Pull-up for CCI I2C busses */
+				regulator-always-on;
 			};
 
 			vreg_l7p: ldo7 {
